{"scene_id": "s00242", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00242.fountain", "heading": "EXT. LIFEBOAT ADRIFT, SOUTHERN OCEAN - NOON", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "CAPTAIN ISOLDE VANDERHOEK-MWAMBA", "names": ["CAPTAIN ISOLDE VANDERHOEK-MWAMBA", "ISOLDE"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 11}, {"id": 1, "name": "ENSIGN REMY LAFAYETTE-OSUNDE", "names": ["ENSIGN REMY LAFAYETTE-OSUNDE", "REMY"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 2, "name": "MAGS", "names": ["MAGS"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 3, "name": "ODELL-PRZYBYLSKI", "names": ["ODELL-PRZYBYLSKI"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. LIFEBOAT ADRIFT, SOUTHERN OCEAN - NOON", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A grey swell.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A hull the colour of old teeth.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "The sun a dull coin behind cloud.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Three figures crowd the boat.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "CAPTAIN ISOLDE VANDERHOEK-MWAMBA (50s, cracked lips, officer's cap tied under her chin) sits at the tiller, jaw tight.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from her, ENSIGN REMY LAFAYETTE-OSUNDE (20s, one arm in a makeshift sling, blistered nose) holds a half-empty water tin in his good hand.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "In the bow, the ship's cook, MARGUERITE \"MAGS\" ODELL-PRZYBYLSKI (60s, apron still on, salt in her eyebrows), stares at the horizon with her chin on her knees.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Captain, the ration.", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Two sips. Each.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Last night it was three.", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Last night I thought we'd be rescued by today.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's what I thought yesterday.", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["not turning"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mags, don't.", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm only saying.", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Pass the tin.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Remy hands it over.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "She takes a sip, wipes her mouth, passes it on.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Mags takes hers without looking.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Captain, how long do you give us?", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't give things.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How long do you think?", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Three days. Four if the rain comes.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And if it doesn't?", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we'll know.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "The swell lifts them, lowers them.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There.", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where?", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There! A light!", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Remy scrambles up, rocking the boat.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Isolde grabs the gunwale.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "A speck of white glints on the horizon.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ship. It's a ship.", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a glare.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's moving!", "name": "REMY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's moving!", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a gull.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "The speck rises, banks, and becomes a seabird, wheeling above the waves.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "It cries once and flies away from them.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Remy sinks back.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Mags laughs, a cracked little sound.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Then she cries, then she laughs again.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mags.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Pass the tin.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's empty.", "name": "MAGS", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Pass it anyway.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}